cpt-city gradient palettes

Many gradient palettes come from the cpt-city collection
(http://seaviewsensing.com/pub/cpt-city/) and were converted for FastLED by
the WLED and FastLED contributors. The source of each palette is named next
to it in shared/engine/src/palettes.h. They are used under the terms set by
each palette author.
